      "content": "but i've tried all the new ways. the coping, the therapy, just trying to adapt... it's like i'm just rearranging the furniture in a prison cell. the walls are still there. it feels like the only thing that actually changes is nothing. like the only way to actually be free of this weight is to not have to carry it anymore.",
